# Example: $ mixed with nested ordinary components

## Schema

```
Game = PlayArea $Time
PlayArea = Rect
Rect = Int/x Int/y Int/width Int/height
Time = Int/t
```

## Construction

```
[:Game [:PlayArea [0 0 800 600]] [:Time 0]]
```

## Methods

```
Time::update! = { [:Time t] }
Game::update! = { [:Game playArea time] }
```

## Target

```
%terminal

%main
public static function main():Void {
    var game = GameAssemblage.factory();
    var helper = new WCHNTHelper();
    trace(game.toConstruction(0, helper));
    game.time.update_mutates();
    trace(game.toConstruction(0, helper));
}
```
